<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: everflower -->
  <VV_Everflower.label>永盛花</VV_Everflower.label>
  <!-- EN: An everflower is an extremely rare bloom revered as sacred by vivis and endowed with a range of mysterious powers. It cannot be transplanted or cultivated by conventional means and may only be moved by a royal vivi in psychic resonance.\n\nOnly vivis can harvest its honey, and when they do, they convert their physical age into mana and absorb it.\n\nA royal vivi resonates with an everflower through psychic attunement, granting access to various mystical abilities. A royal vivi can resonate with only one everflower. An everflower that has been attuned even once can no longer be dismantled.\n\n\nIn vivi society, it's traditional to give each vivi who sets out to build a new nest a single everflower seed, and it's said that in the distant past an enormous everflower once existed. -->
  <VV_Everflower.description>永盛花是一種極其稀有的神秘花朵，被薇薇奉為神圣且賦有一系列神秘力量。永盛花不能通過常規方式移栽，只能被心靈共鳴的皇家薇薇移動。\n\n只有薇薇能收獲這種花的蜜，此時，薇薇的年齡會被永盛花轉化為魔能并消耗。\n\n皇家薇薇能和永盛花進行心靈共鳴來獲得神秘能力。一名皇家薇薇只能共鳴一株永盛花，被共鳴過的永盛花無法再被拆解。\n\n在薇薇社會的傳統中，每個外出筑巢的薇薇都會被贈與一顆永盛花種子。據說在遙遠的過去，曾有一株巨大的永盛花盛放過。</VV_Everflower.description>
  
</LanguageData>